OL,3,AUK economy grows at fastest rate for
OL,4,Amore than two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrong growth in the services sector -
OL,7,Fwhich includes things such as
OL,8,Fconsultancy services and hotels and
OL,9,Frestaurants - helped drive the stronger
OL,10,Fgrowth.
